OL,3,AGerman elections under way which could
OL,4,Adecide fate of Chancellor Merz
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere has been speculation in Germany
OL,7,Fthat Merz could be replaced as
OL,8,Fchancellor mid-term unless the CDU's
OL,9,Fpolitical fortunes improve.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
